1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Whose shape am I wearing?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
A borrowed length feels heavy.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You found your own way.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
I need not outgrow myself.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
My measure is my own.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Let the extra weight go.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The right fit lets me stand tall.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Even scraps can become kindness.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Different, yet onward together.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Shine at your own pace.
